# Manus Capacity Pool Keys
# Format supports:
# 1. Email pairs: acc1@example.com sk-... acc2@example.com sk-...
# 2. Comma-separated: sk-...,sk-...
# 3. Space-separated: sk-... sk-...
MANUS_KEYS=acc1@domain.com sk-proj-1234567890 acc2@domain.com sk-proj-0987654321

# Optional API URL Override (default: https://api.manus.ai)
# MANUS_BASE_URL=https://api.manus.ai
